   "like_count": 4,
   "cooked": "<p>The main idea, is start in the translation of papers, articles and relevant information to spanish language. Also creating spanish channels like the actual ones in english. The reason is to increase to number of people learning and supporting. Countries have different cultures and situations. Adding a language could expand Token Engineering. Incresing the community with qualified people, helping them to learn facilitating traduction of documents and active channels could increase the robustness of TE Commons.</p>",
